IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`

-- P4-art-37-39: Article 37 (Challenge to the competence of notified bodies), Article 38 (Coordination of notified bodies),
-- Article 39 (Conformity assessment bodies of third countries). None was changed by the Omnibus (marker `▼B`): one text, both versions.
-- Every function takes `the date asked` first and answers NOTHING before Chapter III Section 4 applies (2 August 2025).

§ `Articles 37 to 39: the parties and acts of the regulative rules`

DECLARE `Art 37 party` IS ONE OF
    `Art 37 Commission`
    `Art 37 notifying authority`

DECLARE `Art 37 act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 37(1) investigate the cases where there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body`
    `Art 37(2) provide the Commission, on request, with all relevant information`
    `Art 37(3) treat the sensitive information obtained in the course of its investigations confidentially`
    `Art 37(4) inform the notifying Member State and request it to take the necessary corrective measures`

DECLARE `Art 38 party` IS ONE OF
    `Art 38 Commission`
    `Art 38 notifying authority`

DECLARE `Art 38 act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 38(1) put in place and properly operate coordination and cooperation in the form of a sectoral group`
    `Art 38(2) ensure that the bodies notified by it participate in the work of the group`
    `Art 38(3) provide for the exchange of knowledge and best practices between notifying authorities`

§ `Article 37(1): investigating doubts about a notified body`

-- src:624 | 1. The Commission shall, where necessary, investigate all cases where there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body or the continued fulfilment by a notified body of the requirements laid down in Article 31 and of its applicable responsibilities.
@ref Art 37(1) (src:624)
-- Gloss: where necessary, the Commission investigates every case where there is reason to doubt a notified body's competence or its continued fulfilment of Article 31 and of its responsibilities.
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body or the continued fulfilment by it of the requirements laid down in Article 31 and of its applicable responsibilities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an investigation is necessary` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Commission has investigated the case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 37(1) the Commission has investigated the case` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter III Section 4 applies from 2 August 2025
    ELSE IF (NOT `there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body or the continued fulfilment by it of the requirements laid down in Article 31 and of its applicable responsibilities`) OR (NOT `an investigation is necessary`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "where necessary, investigate all cases where there are reasons to doubt" (fork F-unmet-where)
         ELSE JUST `the Commission has investigated the case`  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The Commission shall, where necessary, investigate all cases" (a bare "shall" not done)

-- No time limit and no consequence is stated, so no trace can show this rule breached.
-- src:624 | 1. The Commission shall, where necessary, investigate all cases where there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body or the continued fulfilment by a notified body of the requirements laid down in Article 31 and of its applicable responsibilities.
@ref Art 37(1) (src:624)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 37 party` `Art 37 act`
`Art 37(1) the duty of the Commission to investigate` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed before Chapter III Section 4 applies
    ELSE PARTY `Art 37 Commission`
         MUST `Art 37(1) investigate the cases where there are reasons to doubt the competence of a notified body`
         HENCE FULFILLED

