§ `Article 39: conformity assessment bodies of third countries`

-- src:635 | Conformity assessment bodies established under the law of a third country with which the Union has concluded an agreement may be authorised to carry out the activities of notified bodies under this Regulation, provided that they meet the requirements laid down in Article 31 or they ensure an equivalent level of compliance.
@ref Art 39 (src:635)
-- Gloss: a body established under the law of a third country that has an agreement with the Union may be authorised to do a notified body's work, provided it meets Article 31 or ensures an equivalent level of compliance. A "may" on "provided that": NOTHING where the proviso is not met (fork F-39).
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the conformity assessment body is established under the law of a third country` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Union has concluded an agreement with that third country` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the body meets the requirements laid down in Article 31` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the body ensures an equivalent level of compliance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 39 the conformity assessment body of a third country may be authorised to carry out the activities of notified bodies` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter III Section 4 applies from 2 August 2025
    ELSE IF (NOT `the conformity assessment body is established under the law of a third country`) OR (NOT `the Union has concluded an agreement with that third country`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Conformity assessment bodies established under the law of a third country with which the Union has concluded an agreement"
         ELSE IF `the body meets the requirements laid down in Article 31` OR `the body ensures an equivalent level of compliance`
              THEN JUST TRUE
              ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "provided that they meet the requirements laid down in Article 31 or they ensure an equivalent level of compliance" (a power named by "may", gated by "provided that": the grant ruling of 2026-11-12)
